ent-PillNeuroClarity = neuroclarity pill
    .desc = Clears only the latent stage: one unit removes 10%, ten units clear it. Does nothing for later stages or an IPC.
ent-PillSchizotoxin = schizotoxin pill
    .desc = Forces acute schizophrenia. Bypasses antagonist immunity.
ent-PillPsychogenLatent = psychogen-L pill
    .desc = Forces latent schizophrenia.
ent-PillPsychiatryRemedy = schizophrenia remedy
    .suffix = Admin
    .desc = Clears every schizophrenia stage. Does nothing to an IPC.

ent-ClothingHeadNeuroMesh = neuro-mesh
    .desc = A cranial mesh. An encephalograph reads which brain region is firing through it.
ent-HandheldEncephalograph = encephalograph
    .desc = A brain monitor. Through a neuro-mesh it lights the region that just fired: speech, hearing, sight, movement, fear, arousal. Requires Advanced Treatment. Works without schizophrenia.
ent-LobotomyTool = lobotomy kit
    .desc = Cast hammer and chisel. On any organic stage it drops three at once. Blindness, deafness, or muteness are possible. It does not work on an IPC.
ent-ShockTherapyPaddles = shock therapy unit
    .desc = A two-handed unit with round electrodes. Shocks any creature; without a medical gag the jaw breaks. Metal conducts to anyone touching it. Wood does not conduct. Connected puddles conduct: fuel catches fire, the water that was struck evaporates, and rubber boots block that shock. On any schizophrenia stage it drops two and can blind, deafen, or mute. On an IPC it scrambles the processor and worsens cyberpsychosis.
ent-ClothingMaskMedicalGag = medical gag
    .desc = A jaw guard. Without it, shock therapy breaks the jaw.

reagent-name-schizotoxin = schizotoxin
reagent-desc-schizotoxin = Forces acute schizophrenia and ignores antagonist immunity.
reagent-name-psychiatry-remedy = schizophrenia remedy
reagent-desc-psychiatry-remedy = Clears every schizophrenia stage. Does nothing to a positronic brain.
reagent-name-neuroclarity = neuroclarity
reagent-desc-neuroclarity = Clears only the latent stage. One unit removes 10%, ten units clear it. Does nothing for simple, acute, or a positronic brain. Mixed from benzene and carbon.
reagent-effect-guidebook-psychiatry-clarity = Removes 10% of the latent stage per unit. Later stages are unchanged.
reagent-effect-guidebook-psychiatry-psychogen = Every 5 units raise schizophrenia by one stage, never past acute.
reagent-effect-guidebook-psychiatry-inhale = A breath raises schizophrenia by one stage about every half minute. Positronics are unaffected. A gas mask, sealed helmet, or a breath mask with a tank blocks the gas.
reagent-name-psychogen-gas = psychogen
reagent-desc-psychogen-gas = A gas. Each breath raises a biological's schizophrenia by one stage about every half minute. A gas mask, bio hood, sealed helmet, or a breath mask with a connected tank blocks it. Positronics are unaffected.
ent-GasCanisterPsychogen = psychogen canister
    .suffix = Event
    .desc = An event canister. An open release valve floods the room. Breathing it raises schizophrenia in biologicals.
psychiatry-radio-verb = says

psychiatry-patch-roboticist = Assembly requires the Robotics skill.
psychiatry-spike-roboticist = Assembly requires the Robotics skill.
ent-FirmwarePatch = firmware patch
    .desc = A one-use cartridge. Clears only latent cyberpsychosis.
ent-AdminFirmwarePatch = admin firmware patch
    .suffix = Admin
    .desc = Clears every cyberpsychosis stage.
ent-HardResetProbe = hard-reset probe
    .desc = On any stage it drops three at once. The reset can burn out a sensor bus.
ent-IonScrubber = ion scrubber
    .desc = A fast discharge. On any stage it drops two, shocks the chassis, and can fault a bus.
ent-CascadeSpike = cascade spike
    .desc = A one-use probe that forces cyberpsychosis in a positronic.
reagent-name-psychogen-latent = psychogen-L
reagent-desc-psychogen-latent = A cocktail of space drugs, impedrezene, and desoxyephedrine. Every five metabolized units raise one stage. Fifteen units from healthy reach acute, and it never goes past that.

